# aether-runtime.package — the model runtime service and API.
name: aether-runtime
version_from: VERSION
recipe: packaging/PKGBUILD-aether-ai
license: GPL-3.0-only
source: ai
installs_to:
  /usr/libexec/aether/ai: ai/
unit: system/services/aether-runtime.service (dynamic user, sandbox restrictions in security/sandbox/runtime-sandbox.conf)
provides:
  - /run/aether/runtime.sock (JSON-RPC: Runtime.{status,models_list,models_recommend,download_start,infer,warmup,unload})
  - local-only inference endpoint per ai/runtime/privacy
depends: [python, python-yaml]
models_note: No model weights are shipped or fetched; downloads are consent-gated
  via ai/runtime/download + ai/policies.
